The experimental Particle Sliders source patch derives from HyperGAN/particle-sliders
and a local experimental PG0.10 integration of that MIT-licensed project. Its
copyright and license are retained in the patched dependency. ParticleGAN is
MIT-licensed. No Tiny Aya-derived model weights, hidden states, training examples,
or source files are included here. The linked article supplies the method idea.

Competition data, mirror archives, third-party wheels, pretrained Gemma weights,
and generated model artifacts are not redistributed in this Git repository.
